ex color array when the vertex count changes*\r\nFor the sake of familiarity for people that have not been using vertex coloring (which I assume is most people), vertex coloring is disabled by default, and is now enabled with a checkbox right below the \"color\" property. *This is what also enables the automatic resizing. I or someone else will need to update the docs to account for this new node property if this is merged.~~\r\n\r\n- The vertex_colors property is now a Typed Dictionary that defines which vertices have their color value overridden from the default 'Color' property\r\n\r\n- a vertex coloring tab was added to the polygon editor plugin wherein you can change vertex colors with a paintbrush\r\n\r\nAlso, since this is reusing code from the bone painting tools, some of the internal variable names for bone painting related objects have been renamed to clarify their more broad purpose now.\r\n\r\n(At least partially) fulfills the needs of:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8195\r\nResolves:\r\n#25120\r\n\r\nDemonstration:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/926acc00-098d-4140-9471-7f7e872f265d\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine